--[[
    MAWWW HUB — ALL BUGS FIXED (audit pass on SILENT_VEIL_SPEAR_THROW_FIXED)
    Static audit only; NOT runtime-tested inside Roblox. Changes (all marked [MAWWW FIX] or tagged inline):
      1. Run token + MAWWW_Conn: re-execution now kills loops/connections of the previous run
         (VD is shared via getgenv, so VD.Destroyed alone could never stop old loops).
      2. Floating launcher: build/bind/ensure functions; rebuilt if destroyed, re-parented if removed,
         stuck-drag flags reset, position remembered, only ONE launcher.
      3. Duplicate-launcher sweeps: no more full CoreGui/PlayerGui descendant scans every 0.2/0.5 s,
         restricted to Mawww-owned ScreenGuis (game GUIs and feature buttons are never hidden).
      4. Main window ScreenGui: ResetOnSpawn=false, re-parent attempt on show.
      5. Camera: Third Person no longer forces CameraType=Custom every frame.
      6. Moonwalk: per-frame callback disconnects itself when disabled (it fought Shift Lock/AutoRotate).
      7. Status panels (Parry / Veil knock): re-attach if their container was cleared.
      8. Silent Veil hooks from older executions become pass-through (no stacking overhead/conflicts).
      9. First paint: one yield after the window is shown so the UI renders before feature registration ends.
]]
