-- Compact vertical navigation: shrink rows and reclaim space from the logo/search
-- area so all feature tabs can fit from the top to the bottom on mobile.
function MAWWW_ApplyCompactFullHeightTabs()
    -- The Mawww Hub UI shell owns tab sizing and scrolling. Avoid modifying its
